+
+## Usage reporting across tool rounds
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the sum of usage reported by every provider call in that turn; rounds without usage contribute nothing, and a turn with no reported usage receives `undefined` ([validated by: reports the sum of every provider call, ignoring rounds without usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L62)).
